<title>MEXICO: Month-end and speculation drive up Cetes rates.</title>
<headline>Month-end and speculation drive up Cetes rates.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-of-month pressures and speculative operations drove up same-day Cetes rates by 400 basis points to 21.50 percent in the secondary market in late trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
</text>
